{title: Badi Suni Suni Hai}
{artist: Kishore Kumar S D Burman}
{key: G}

{c: Verse 1}
[G]badi sunee sun [Em]ee hai,        [D]zindagi ye [C]zinda [G]gi
main khud se hun ya [Em]haan,        [D]ajnabi, [C]ajna [G]bi
[G]kabhi ek [C]pal bhi,        kahin ye [G]udaasi
[D]dil mera [G]bhoole,        [G]tabhi mus [C]kurakar
dabe paanw aa [G]kar,        [D]dukh mujhe [G]chhule
[G]na kar mujhse [Em]gam mere,        dilla [D]gi ye [C]dil [G]lagi
[G]kabhi main na [C]soyaa,        kahin mujh se [G]khoyaa
[D]sukh mera [G]aise,        [G]pataa naam [C]likhaakar
kahin yuhin [G]rakhakar,        [D]bhoole koi [G]jaise
[G]ajab dukh [Em]bharee hain ye,        [D]bebasi, [C]be [G]basi
